{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"哥林多后书","commonName":"哥林多后书","title":"哥林多后书","order":47,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"d1b3add7116ae7f152667b93111f4f75806cdef8405d74ca4bedadc7a7d5d7f7","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CO/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":255},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["身为上帝的同工，我们劝你们不要辜负祂的恩典。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因为祂说：",{"text":"“在悦纳的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我应允了你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在拯救的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我帮助了你。”","poem":1},{"noteId":2},"看啊，现在正是悦纳的时候！看啊，现在正是拯救的日子！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝仆人的品格"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["为了避免有人毁谤我们的职分，我们凡事尽量不妨碍别人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["反倒在任何事上都显明自己是上帝的仆人。不论遭遇什么患难、艰苦、贫穷、"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["鞭打、囚禁、暴乱、辛劳、无眠或饥饿，我们都坚忍到底，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["靠着纯洁、知识、忍耐、仁慈、圣灵的感动、无伪的爱心、"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["真理之道、上帝的大能、左右手中的公义兵器，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["无论是得荣耀还是受羞辱，遭毁谤还是得称赞，都显明自己是上帝的仆人。我们被视为骗子，却是诚实无伪；"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["似乎默默无闻，却是家喻户晓；似乎快死了，看啊！我们却仍然活着；受严刑拷打，却没有丧命；"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["似乎郁郁寡欢，却常常喜乐；似乎一贫如洗，却使多人富足；似乎一无所有，却样样都有！"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["哥林多人啊！我们对你们推心置腹，开诚布公，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["毫无保留，只是你们自己心胸狭窄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["现在请你们也向我们敞开心怀。我这样说，是把你们当成自己的儿女。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["永活上帝的殿"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["不要和非信徒同负一轭，因为公义和不法怎能合作呢？光明和黑暗怎能共存呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["基督与魔鬼",{"noteId":3},"怎能相容呢？信徒与非信徒有什么相干呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["上帝的殿与偶像怎能相提并论呢？因为我们就是永活上帝的殿，正如上帝说：",{"text":"“我要住在他们中间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他们当中往来；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要做他们的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要做我的子民。”","poem":1},{"noteId":4}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["主又说：",{"text":"“所以，你们要从他们中间出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"离开他们，不要沾染污秽之物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就接纳你们。","poem":1},{"noteId":5}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要做你们的父亲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要做我的儿女。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是全能的主说的。”","poem":1},{"noteId":6}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书49:8。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":2}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"“魔鬼”希腊文是“彼列”。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":15}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"利未记26:12；耶利米书32:38；以西结书37:27。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":16}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书52:11；以西结书20:34、41。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":17}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"撒母耳记下7:14；7:8。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":18}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CO/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CO/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2CO/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}